    "updated_at": "2021-09-23T18:01:01Z",
    "body": "I don't like carving out exceptions much myself.\r\n\r\nClearing the state makes more sense to me here; when you get an error page, reload, and get a new page, that feels like a fresh navigation, and not like any kind of session restore where the state would be carried over.",
