    "created_at": "2021-09-27T13:54:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-09-27T13:54:18Z",
    "body": "When discussing this on Matrix I tended towards Domenic's initial position, but I think it's fair to say that for error pages the behavior Jake is suggesting is better for users, especially in the context of a session. Although not the case for every session, most sessions are short-lived and so a network error is more likely a connection issue than anything else. For users it seems more useful to preserve history data in those cases.",
